  "abstract": "Increase factor-MLP capacity from 512x2 to 640x2 under Adam (no wd) with global gradient clipping (norm=1.0). Base is our best global MLP with curvature loss (\u03bb=1e-4). Tests whether moderate width boost improves over 512x2.",
